 "name_en": "External Tax Audit (2OO)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>External Tax Audit (2OO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The External Tax Audit functions enable external tax auditors to conduct detailed audits of a company's accounts using Auditor Direct Access. Auditors can access the data in read-only mode, meaning that they can select, filter, and sort using the taxpayer's hardware and software.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create an audit with the default audit structure</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run the reports and transactions listed in the default audit structure</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display audit log</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run audit journal</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run tax reconciliation account balance</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run tax declaration reconciliation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Access and review the customer's tax relevant data in a read-only mode directly in the system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>外部税务审计 (2OO)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">外部税务审计功能使外部税务审计员能够使用“审计员直接访问”对公司的科目执行详细的审计。审计员可以只读模式访问数据，这意味着他们可以使用纳税人的硬件和软件进行选择、过滤和排序。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用缺省审计结构创建审计</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行默认审计结构中列出的报告和事务。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示审计日志</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行审计日记账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行税收对账科目余额</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行纳税申报对账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio587c142465eb44de9f2ffdbf5d77d6bc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">直接在系统中以只读模式访问和查看客户的税务相关数据。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
